@startuml 系统数据流图

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

title 果蔬智造核心平台 - 数据流图 v1.0\n展示数据在各组件间的流动和转换

' 数据源
rectangle "数据源" as DataSource #E3F2FD {
    (用户上传图片) as UploadImage
    (摄像头快照) as CameraSnapshot
    (用户聊天消息) as ChatMessage
}

' 数据输入层
rectangle "数据输入层" as InputLayer #FFF9C4 {
    [图片文件\nJPG/PNG] as ImageFile
    [快照数据\nBytea] as SnapshotData
    [文本消息\nUTF-8] as TextData
}

' 数据传输层
rectangle "数据传输层" as TransportLayer #C8E6C9 {
    [HTTP Multipart\nForm Data] as Multipart
    [JSON Payload\nREST API] as JsonPayload
    [WebSocket\nFrame] as WebSocketFrame
}

' 数据处理层
rectangle "数据处理层" as ProcessLayer #FFE0B2 {
    package "图像处理" {
        [预处理\nResize/Normalize] as Preprocess
        [DenseNet121\n特征提取] as FeatureExtract
        [质量评估\nA/B/C 分级] as QualityGrade
    }
    
    package "文本处理" {
        [消息解析\nJSON Parser] as MessageParser
        [LLM 推理\nClaude API] as LLMInference
        [MCP 查询\nSQL 执行] as MCPQuery
    }
}

' 数据存储层
database "数据存储层" as StorageLayer #B39DDB {
    frame "PostgreSQL" {
        [uploads 表\n原图 BYTEA] as UploadsTable
        [results 表\nJSONB 结果] as ResultsTable
        [detections 表\n快照数组] as DetectionsTable
        [chat_sessions 表\n会话信息] as SessionsTable
        [chat_messages 表\n消息内容+元数据] as MessagesTable
    }
    
    frame "Redis" {
        [result:<id>\nJSON String] as ResultCache
        [active_session:<id>\nUUID] as SessionCache
        [conversation:<id>\nList<Message>] as ConversationCache
    }
}

' 数据输出层
rectangle "数据输出层" as OutputLayer #C5E1A5 {
    [检测结果 JSON\n{class, confidence, grade}] as DetectionResult
    [统计数据 JSON\n{total, grade_a/b/c}] as Statistics
    [聊天响应 JSON\n{content, tool_calls}] as ChatResponse
}

' 数据展示层
rectangle "数据展示层" as PresentationLayer #90CAF9 {
    (前端 UI\nVue 组件) as FrontendUI
    (可视化图表\nECharts) as Charts
    (聊天界面\nMarkdown) as ChatUI
}

' 数据流连接 - 上传流程
UploadImage --> ImageFile
ImageFile --> Multipart
Multipart --> UploadsTable : "存储原图"
Multipart --> Preprocess : "发送字节流"
Preprocess --> FeatureExtract : "224x224 Tensor"
FeatureExtract --> QualityGrade : "Top-K 预测"
QualityGrade --> ResultsTable : "JSONB 写入"
ResultsTable --> ResultCache : "缓存 900s"
ResultCache --> DetectionResult : "序列化 JSON"
DetectionResult --> FrontendUI : "HTTP 响应"

' 数据流连接 - 检测流程
CameraSnapshot --> SnapshotData
SnapshotData --> DetectionsTable : "直接存储"
DetectionsTable --> Statistics : "聚合查询"
Statistics --> Charts : "可视化展示"

' 数据流连接 - 聊天流程
ChatMessage --> TextData
TextData --> JsonPayload
JsonPayload --> MessageParser
MessageParser --> MessagesTable : "用户消息"
MessageParser --> LLMInference : "构建 Prompt"
LLMInference --> MCPQuery : "工具调用"
MCPQuery --> UploadsTable : "查询数据"
MCPQuery --> ResultsTable : "查询数据"
UploadsTable --> MCPQuery : "返回结果"
ResultsTable --> MCPQuery : "返回结果"
MCPQuery --> LLMInference : "工具输出"
LLMInference --> MessagesTable : "助手响应"
MessagesTable --> ConversationCache : "缓存历史"
ConversationCache --> ChatResponse : "序列化"
ChatResponse --> ChatUI : "Markdown 渲染"

' 数据流连接 - 缓存更新
SessionsTable --> SessionCache : "活跃会话"
MessagesTable --> ConversationCache : "最近 20 条"

note right of StorageLayer
  **数据持久化策略**
  • 原图: PostgreSQL BYTEA (直接存储)
  • 结果: PostgreSQL JSONB + Redis 缓存
  • 快照: PostgreSQL BYTEA 数组
  • 聊天: PostgreSQL TEXT + Redis List
  
  **缓存 TTL**
  • 检测结果: 900 秒
  • 活跃会话: 3600 秒
  • 聊天历史: 1800 秒
end note

note left of ProcessLayer
  **数据转换**
  • 图像: Binary → Tensor → Logits → JSON
  • 文本: String → JSON → SQL → String
  
  **数据格式**
  • 上传: multipart/form-data
  • API: application/json
  • WebSocket: text/json frames
  
  **数据验证**
  • 图片: 格式/大小检查
  • SQL: 注入防护/白名单
  • JSON: Schema 验证
end note

legend right
  |= 颜色 |= 说明 |
  | <#E3F2FD> | 数据源 |
  | <#FFF9C4> | 输入层 |
  | <#C8E6C9> | 传输层 |
  | <#FFE0B2> | 处理层 |
  | <#B39DDB> | 存储层 |
  | <#C5E1A5> | 输出层 |
  | <#90CAF9> | 展示层 |
  
  **数据流类型**
  • 实线箭头: 同步数据流
  • 虚线箭头: 异步数据流
  
  **生成时间**: 2025-10-15
endlegend

@enduml
